        <argsstring></argsstring>
        <name>SourceBlockAddressOffset</name>
        <qualifiedname>MDMA_InitTypeDef::SourceBlockAddressOffset</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>this field specifies the Next block source address offset signed value : if &gt; 0 then increment the next block source Address by offset from where the last block ends if &lt; 0 then decrement the next block source Address by offset from where the last block ends if == 0, the next block source address starts from where the last block ends </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
